      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/mill_spring_north_carolina"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Mill Spring’s mixed hardwood forests feature dry‑mesic oak‑hickory on upper slopes and basic‑mesic on lower north‑facing areas.",
